Books","year":"2021"},{"page":6,"title":"A mongoose talking with cricket","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":7,"title":"A mongoose talking with snake","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":8,"title":"A mongoose walking near lake","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":9,"title":"A mongoose talking with frog","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":10,"title":"A frog jumping","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":11,"title":"A frog jumping into water","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":12,"title":"Mongoose picking figs","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"},{"page":13,"title":"Lotus on the lake","illustrator":"Samidha Gunjal","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2021"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಮರಿ ಮುಂಗುಸಿಗೆ ಅಂಜೂರದ ಹಣ್ಣು ತಿಂದು ಬೇಜಾರಾಗಿದೆ!","ಅದಕ್ಕೆ ಕಪ್ಪೆಯ ರುಚಿ ನೋಡಬೇಕು ಎನಿಸಿದೆ.","ಆದರೆ, ಕಪ್ಪೆ ನೋಡಲು ಹೇಗೆ ಕಾಣುತ್ತದೆ?"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಹೇ, ನೀನು ಕಪ್ಪೆಯೇ?”","“ಇಲ್ಲ! ನಾನು ಬೆಳ್ಳಕ್ಕಿ. ಕಪ್ಪೆಗೆ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲುಗಳಿರುತ್ತವೆ.”"]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಹೇ, ನಿನಗೆ ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲುಗಳಿವೆ. ನೀನು ಕಪ್ಪೆಯೇ?”","“ಇಲ್ಲ! ಕಪ್ಪೆಗೆ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳಿವೆ.”"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಿನ್ನ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು ದೊಡ್ಡದಾಗಿವೆ. ನನಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತು, ನೀನು ಪಕ್ಕಾ ಕಪ್ಪೆಯೇ ಎಂದು!”","“ಇಲ್ಲ! ನಾನು ಗೂಬೆ. ಕಪ್ಪೆಯ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಸಿರು.”"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಆಹ್! ನಿನ್ನ ಬಣ್ಣ ಹಸಿರಾಗಿದೆ.","ನೀನೇ ಕಪ್ಪೆ ಎಂದು ನನಗೆ ಗೊತ್ತು!”","“ಇಲ್ಲ! ನಾನು ಮಿಡತೆ. ಕಪ್ಪೆಯ ಮೈಮೇಲೆ ಕಪ್ಪು ಕಲೆಗಳಿರುತ್ತವೆ.”"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಿನ್ನ ಮೈಮೇಲೆ ಕಪ್ಪು ಕಲೆಗಳಿವೆ.","ನೀನು ಕಪ್ಪೆಯೇ?”","“ನನ್ನ ಮೈಮೇಲೆ ಕಪ್ಪು ಕಲೆಗಳಿವೆ.","ಆದರೆ, ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲುಗಳು ಕಾಣುತ್ತಿವೆಯೇ?”"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನಾಲ್ಕು ಕಾಲುಗಳು... ದೊಡ್ಡ ಕಣ್ಣುಗಳು...","ಹಸಿರು ಬಣ್ಣ… ಕಪ್ಪು ಕಲೆಗಳು...”"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ನೀನು ಕಪ್ಪೆ! ನಾನು ಗುರುತಿಸಿದೆ ತಾನೇ?”"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಹೌದು, ನಾನು ಕಪ್ಪೆ! ಆದರೆ, ನಿನಗೆ ಯಾರೂ ಏಕೆ ಹೇಳಲಿಲ್ಲ","ನಾನು ಜಿಗಿಯಬಲ್ಲೆ ಕೂಡ ಎಂದು.”"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":["“ಹೀಗೆ!”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["“ಅಯ್ಯೋ! ಇವತ್ತೂ ನಾನು ಅಂಜೂರದ ಹಣ್ಣುಗಳನ್ನೇ ತಿನ್ನಬೇಕು!”"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/474117-kappe-thinnalu-horata-mari-mungusi/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":507},"text":[]}],"wordCount":112}